    "group": "Covenite Coterie",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Any phase after your HAEMONCULUS dies, choose it and pay Pain tokens in a quantity from 1 to 3. At phase end, put it back unengaged, as near its death site as possible. Restore wounds equal to the tokens spent. If it was attached, it returns as a separate unit at starting strength 1. This requires at least one Pain token and is limited to one use per model per battle; it cannot be used with 0 tokens.",
